# Hugo. publishDir is public/ as of 2026-08-14 (was docs/, and committed).
# docs/ stays ignored so a stale local build cannot be re-tracked: Hugo never prunes its
# publish dir, so a committed one silently accumulates superseded fingerprinted CSS and
# feeds pointing at localhost, then serves them.
/public/
/docs/
/resources/_gen/
.hugo_build.lock

# Plugin docs used to be fetched at build time by scripts/fetch-skills.sh. Retired
# 2026-08-14 (athan-dial/skills deleted; the dev plugin is now private dev:* skills), so
# nothing writes per-plugin bundles here any more. The ignore is kept so a leftover local
# bundle from before the retirement cannot get committed by accident; case studies stay
# checked in.
/content/skills/*/
!/content/skills/case-studies/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Environment
.env
.env.local

# Internal evidence material — THIS REPO IS PUBLIC.
# Contains employer-confidential program/tool codenames, internal Confluence page
# IDs, Slack permalinks, colleague-attributed sources, and unpublished metrics.
# Never commit. Sanitized, publishable conclusions belong in .planning/*.md instead.
/.planning/private/

# Local-only artifacts, never published or committed
_private/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Process exhaust — kept locally, never published. This repo is PUBLIC, and
# .planning/ is the tree that previously leaked 946 lines of internal material
# (see the history rewrite of 2026-08-12). Do not re-track these.
# A short allowlist below keeps the few docs that code comments cite.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_bmad/
_bmad-output/
.cursor/
.dev/
.DS_Store
model-citizen/
layouts.blowfish.bak/

.planning/*
!.planning/ACCESSIBILITY-CHECKS.md
!.planning/CONTENT-SAFETY-CONTRACT.md
!.planning/CONTENT-MODEL.md
!.planning/DEPLOY-MIGRATION.md
!.planning/VOICE-REFERENCE.md
!.planning/design/
.planning/design/*
!.planning/design/REDESIGN-PLAN.md
